<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">设备与协议调试控制台</view>
    <view class="muted">
      用于开发期模拟硬件故障、协议时序与检查 10 物理槽位在位状态。
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 故障场景注入 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">全局 Mock 故障场景注入</view>
    <picker
      range="{{scenarios}}"
      range-key="label"
      value="{{scenarioIndex}}"
      bindchange="onScenarioChange"
    >
      <view class="picker-box">
        <text class="muted">当前模式：</text>
        <text class="picker-value">{{scenarios[scenarioIndex].label}}</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="muted small mt-8">
      切换后，小程序发起的所有取钥/归还操作将按照该异常时序执行。
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 槽位在位监控 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">一号钥匙柜 (CAB001) 物理槽位监控</view>
    <view class="slot-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{slots}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="slot-cell {{item.presence === 'PRESENT' ? 'slot-present' : 'slot-absent'}} {{!item.enabled ? 'slot-disabled' : ''}}"
      >
        <view class="slot-num">#{{item.slotNo}}</view>
        <view class="slot-key">{{item.keyId || '空槽'}}</view>
        <view class="slot-status">
          {{!item.enabled ? '已停用' : (item.presence === 'PRESENT' ? '在位' : '已离柜')}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-secondary center" bindtap="resetMockData">
    重置所有 Mock 数据为初始状态
  </view>
</view>
